VIMA VST
8-track melodic MIDI step sequencer (VST3)
Version @PROJECT_VERSION@


INSTALL

Windows
  Copy the Vima.vst3 folder to:
  C:\Program Files\Common Files\VST3\

macOS
  Copy Vima.vst3 to /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/
  This build is not notarized by Apple, so macOS blocks it at first.
  Open Terminal and run:
  xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/Vima.vst3

Linux
  Copy the Vima.vst3 folder to ~/.vst3/ (just for you)
  or /usr/lib/vst3/ (all users). Create the folder if needed.

Then restart your DAW or rescan plugins. Vima shows up as an instrument.


MANUAL

The full manual is inside the plugin: open Settings (gear icon)
and click MANUAL.


